L["A small funnel at the top-left of the tracker that opens a list of the filters, so you can turn quest types and the current-zone filter on and off in a couple of clicks. The list stays open while you tick boxes, and the funnel turns gold while any filter is hiding quests. It changes the same filters as the Filters card. Off by default."] = "追蹤框左上角的小漏斗，點擊打開過濾器列表，幾次點擊即可開關任務類型和當前區域過濾。勾選時列表保持開啟，任何過濾器隱藏任務時漏斗變為金色。它與「過濾器」分組是同一組設定。預設關閉。"
L["A unified replacement for the Blizzard quest experience: a custom tracker, objective markers on the map and minimap, nameplate quest icons, and a browser for the quests you have not picked up yet."] = "一套完整替代暴雪任務體驗的工具：自訂追蹤器、世界地圖與小地圖上的目標標記、姓名板任務圖示，以及尚未接取任務的瀏覽器。"
L["A unified replacement for the Blizzard quest experience: a custom tracker, world-map overlays, quest history, and a Midnight chain guide."] = "一套完整替代暴雪任務體驗的工具：自訂追蹤器、世界地圖覆蓋層、任務歷史記錄以及午夜版本任務鏈指南。"
L["Account-wide alt overview"] = "全帳號分身總覽"
L["Account-wide quest rewards. Totals count only quests turned in while reward tracking was on; older entries didn't capture XP or gold."] = "帳號級任務獎勵統計。僅統計開啟獎勵追蹤後提交的任務；更早的歷史記錄不會捕獲經驗與金幣。"
L["Adds the quest log heading each quest came from as a small line under its title."] = "在任務標題下方小字顯示該任務所屬的任務日誌分類。"
L["Adds the quest log heading each quest came from as a small line under its title. Not shown while Show zone headers is on, on the Appearance tab."] = "在任務標題下方小字顯示該任務所屬的任務日誌分類。「外觀」標籤頁開啟「顯示區域標題」時不顯示。"
L["Also reads the progress other quest addons broadcast, so you see everyone in the group rather than only the people running EQ. When you join a group EQ asks those addons for their quest logs, the same way they ask each other. Your own progress is never sent on their channel."] = "同時讀取其他任務插件廣播的進度，這樣你能看到隊伍中的所有人，而不只是使用 EQ 的玩家。加入隊伍時，EQ 會像這些插件彼此之間那樣向它們請求任務日誌。你自己的進度絕不會透過它們的頻道發送。"
L["An on-screen panel while inside a delve showing the story variant and its grade, the recommended curios for your role, your run timer, and your death count."] = "在探究中的畫面面板，顯示劇情變體及其評級、適合你職責的建議珍奇物品、計時器和死亡次數。"
L["Applies to spells flagged Important in the Filters tab. Important spells use the hold and sound below instead of the normal ones."] = "適用於在【過濾器】標籤頁中標記為【重要】的法術。重要法術會使用下方的【高亮時長】與【高亮音效】，而非普通法術的那一組設定。"
