L["Font for the countdown number, drawn by the game's cooldown widget. Restyling applies on Retail."] = "倒數數字所用的字體，由遊戲的冷卻元件繪製。樣式調整在正式服生效。"
L["For example, 3/9. Applies to every section header and zone header."] = "例如：3/9，作用於全部板塊標題和區域標題。"
L["For example, 3/9. Applies to every section header."] = "例如：3/9，作用於全部板塊標題。"
