L["Home"] = "主頁"
L["How a cooldown's time-left maps to its spot on the lane. Linear spaces time evenly; Timeline and Logarithmic compress long timers so near-ready cooldowns spread out; Split places icons using your own time-to-position points below."] = "冷卻的剩餘時間如何對應到軌道上的位置。【線性】依時間平均分布；【時間軸】與【對數】會壓縮長計時，讓接近就緒的冷卻拉開距離；【分段】則依你在下方自訂的時間-位置節點放置圖示。"
L["How Cooldown Master tells you about a new version: a Popup window, a quiet clickable Chat link in your chat, or Off. Reopen the notes any time with /cm whatsnew."] = "Cooldown Master 通知新版本的方式：【彈出視窗】、在聊天視窗中安靜顯示的【聊天連結】，或【關閉】。隨時輸入 /cm whatsnew 可重新開啟更新說明。"
L["How long the timer runs after the trigger fires. Type an exact value in the box below the slider."] = "觸發後計時持續多久。可在滑桿下方的欄位中填寫精確數值。"
L["How quest, achievement and endeavor titles are colored. Failed quests are always red, and finished ones green unless Use title color for completed quests is on."] = "任務、成就、活動標題的著色方式。失敗的任務始終為紅色，已完成的任務為綠色，除非開啟「已完成任務使用標題文字顏色」。"
L["How this one behaves once it pops into a ready box.\n\nNormal - fades after the box's Display Duration.\n\nImportant - highlights the icon and holds it for the box's Highlight Duration instead, and plays the box's Highlight Sound (set to None until you pick one).\n\nPinned - the icon never fades. It stays until you reload or switch profile, and a box full of pinned icons has no room for new pops.\n\nImp + Pin - both."] = "此冷卻彈入就緒框後的行為。\n\n普通：在該框的【顯示時長】後淡出。\n\n重要：高亮該圖示並改為保持該框的【高亮時長】，同時播放該框的【高亮音效】（在你選擇之前為【無】）。\n\n固定：圖示永不淡出。它會一直保留，直到你重載介面或切換設定檔，而被固定圖示佔滿的框將沒有空間容納新的彈出。\n\n重要 + 固定：兩者兼具。"
L["In the Labyrinth, every third chamber counts here, and Kindo'jan does once a week from Tier 8."] = "在迷宮中，每完成3個密室都會計入此處，金多詹則從級別8起每週計入一次。"
