L["Replaces the tracker scroll bar's textured thumb (the draggable block) with a flat single-color block. Use the Thumb Color and Thumb Width controls to style it. Off restores the stock Blizzard bar."] = "將追蹤框滾動條紋理滑塊（可拖動塊）替換為純色扁平滑塊。可通過滑塊顏色、滑塊寬度進行自定義。關閉則恢復暴雪原生滾動條。"
L["Restore every option to its default value."] = "把每一項設定恢復為預設值。"
L["Restores every control on this tab, including the zone bar block, to its default. Other tabs are left alone."] = "將本標簽頁全部選項（包含區域進度條）恢復預設，其他標簽頁不受影響。"
L["Restores every setting on every tab to its default and reloads the interface. This also clears the Options Window Scale, which every character shares, and this character's collapsed sections and individually hidden entries."] = "全部標簽頁恢復預設並重載界面。同時重置全角色共享的選項窗口縮放，以及本角色折疊板塊、單獨隱藏條目。"
L["Run this lane top-to-bottom instead of left-to-right. Toggling it swaps the lane's Width and Height (Appearance tab) so the bar keeps its shape, just rotated."] = "讓此軌道由上而下運行，而非由左至右。切換時會對調軌道的寬度與高度（外觀標籤頁），使其保持原有形狀，僅是旋轉。"
L["Runs kept per delve:"] = "每個探究保留的紀錄數："
L["Sanctified Banner - find it for bonus loot"] = "Sanctified Banner - 找到它即可獲得額外戰利品"
L["Sanctified Banner - Grand Spoils earned!"] = "Sanctified Banner - 已獲得豐厚戰利品！"
L["Sanctified Banner - kill the Voidfused Rager!"] = "Sanctified Banner - 擊殺 Voidfused Rager！"
L["Sanctified Banner found - bonus Spoils secured"] = "已找到 Sanctified Banner - 額外戰利品到手"
L["Season 2 also gives her a Poison slot. This popup does not cover it yet - the Nemesis tab already recommends one for Azta'rec."] = "第 2 賽季還給了她一個毒藥欄。這個彈窗暫時還不涵蓋它 - 死敵頁面已經為 Azta'rec 建議了一種。"
L["Sends a cooldown to a lane based on how long it is rather than what kind it is, so short cooldowns can run a fast lane and long ones a slow lane. A lane you picked for an individual spell still wins over this, and anything whose length CooldownMaster has not learned yet falls back to the category defaults below."] = "按冷卻的長短而不是種類把它送往對應軌道，這樣短冷卻可以走快軌道，長冷卻走慢軌道。你為單個法術指定的軌道仍然優先，而 CooldownMaster 尚未學到長度的項目會回退到下方的分類預設值。"
L["Set!"] = "已設定！"
L["Show Options icon on the tracker"] = "追蹤框顯示設置圖標"
L["Show What's New after an update"] = "更新後顯示更新內容"
L["Shows the What's New window once after each update. You can always reopen it from the About tab or with /ed whatsnew."] = "每次更新後顯示一次更新內容視窗。你可以隨時透過「關於」頁面或 /ed whatsnew 重新開啟。"
L["Slash commands"] = "聊天命令"
L["The First Hash'ey, master of the Labyrinth."] = "初代哈謝，迷宮之主。"
L["The header of the section you are scrolled into stays at the top of the quest list, so you can always see which section you are in. On by default."] = "當前滾動所在板塊的標題會固定在任務列表頂部，隨時可知自己位於哪個板塊。預設開啟。"
L["The most of this crest you're allowed to earn this season - the seasonal earning cap."] = "本賽季你最多能獲得的該紋章數量 - 也就是賽季取得上限。"
L["The Nemesis Delve"] = "死敵探究"
L["the one-time seasonal quest; defeat Azta'rec to earn it."] = "一次性賽季任務；擊敗 Azta'rec 即可獲得。"
L["The same switch as on the Tracker tab, where the number beside each section chooses its tab. Off by default."] = "與「追蹤框」標籤頁中的開關相同，在那裡用每個板塊旁的數字選擇其標籤頁。預設關閉。"
L["The seasonal cap on this crest - how many you can earn for the lower crests, and how many you can hold at once for the higher ones."] = "該紋章的賽季上限 - 低階紋章指你能取得的數量，高階紋章指你能同時持有的數量。"
L["These settings apply to every spell in the chosen category. To override an individual spell, use that category's sub-tab on the left."] = "這些設定套用於所選分類中的每個法術。若要單獨覆寫某個法術，請使用左側該分類的子標籤頁。"
L["This category stays empty on this version of the game.\nIt lists Blizzard's own bar-style tracked buffs, which exist only on retail. The harmful effects you put on a target are under Offensives."] = "此分類在目前版本的遊戲中保持為空。\n它列出的是暴雪內建的條狀追蹤增益，僅存在於正式服。你施加在目標身上的有害效果請見【攻擊效果】。"
L["This frame lets go of a cooldown once it has this many seconds left, so a lane can take it the rest of the way. 0 keeps every cooldown on the bar until it is ready.\n\nThis only decides when the BAR lets go. What decides when the lane picks up is that lane's own Max Time and Hide Long Timers, so set this to the lane's Max Time and make sure Hide Long Timers is on for it. Without that the lane draws the cooldown the whole time, parked at the far end, instead of waiting its turn.\n\nA value above the lane's Max Time leaves a stretch where neither one draws it. It applies to everything routed to this frame, not only to long cooldowns."] = "當冷却只剩下這麼多秒時，此框體就會放手，讓軌道接手剩下的路程。設為 0 則每個冷却都留在計時條上，直到就緒。\n\n這只決定計時條何時放手。決定軌道何時接手的，是該軌道自己的最大時間（秒）和隱藏超長計時。因此請把此值設為軌道的最大時間，並確認該軌道已開啟隱藏超長計時。否則軌道會全程顯示這個冷却，停在最遠端，而不是等到該它的時候。\n\n高於軌道最大時間的值會留下一段兩者都不顯示的空檔。該設定作用於所有被指派到此框體的內容，而不只是長冷却。"
L["This tab is not yet implemented in v%s."] = "此標籤頁在 v%s 中尚未實作。"
L["Three of the six unlock from the quest \"%s\"."] = "六種中有三種透過任務 \"%s\" 解鎖。"
L["Tip: enable Unlock Frames on the Global tab, then drag this box into position."] = "提示：在【全域】標籤頁啟用【解鎖框體】，然後把此框拖到合適位置。"
L["Tip: right-click the minimap button to jump to Options. For support, the author may ask you to run a debug command."] = "提示：右鍵點擊小地圖按鈕可直接跳到設定。為了協助排查問題，作者可能會請你執行某個除錯指令。"
L["Tip: turn on Unlock Frames (Global tab) to drag this frame, and Test (Global tab) to preview bars."] = "提示：開啟【解鎖框體】（全域標籤頁）以拖動此框體，開啟【測試】（全域標籤頁）以預覽計時條。"
L["Turns all six category filters back on and clears the current-zone filter. Nothing else on this tab is changed."] = "重新開啟全部6項分類篩選，清除當前區域篩選。本標簽頁其餘選項保持不變。"
L["Type:"] = "類型："
L["Unknown category: %s"] = "未知分類：%s"
L["Untick to stop tracking this whole category. None of its cooldowns show on a lane or a bar, or pop a ready frame. This is the same setting as Enabled on the Defaults tab."] = "取消勾選以停止追蹤整個分類。其中的冷卻都不會顯示在軌道或計時條上，也不會彈出就緒框。此項與【預設值】標籤頁中的【啟用】是同一個設定。"
L["Untick to stop tracking this whole category. None of its cooldowns will show on a lane or pop a ready frame."] = "取消勾選以停止追蹤整個分類。其中的冷卻都不會顯示在軌道上，也不會彈出就緒框。"
L["Updated"] = "更新"
L["Use Bloodlust or Heroism here, so this phase is as short as possible."] = "在這裡使用嗜血或英勇，讓這一階段盡可能縮短。"
L["Use class color for titles"] = "任務標題使用職業顏色"
L["Visual emphasis drawn on icons flagged Important (per spell, in Filters). Border outlines the icon; Glow and Flash pulse it; Border + Flash does both; None disables it."] = "為標記【重要】的圖示繪製的視覺強調（於過濾器中依法術設定）。【邊框】為圖示描邊；【發光】與【閃爍】使其脈動；【邊框 + 閃爍】兩者兼具；【無】則停用。"
L["What's New in %s"] = "%s 更新內容"
L["What's New Popup"] = "更新內容視窗"
L["When cleared, falls back to difficulty coloring or default yellow."] = "清空後將使用任務難度顏色或預設黃色。"
L["Which bar frame this category's cooldowns appear in. The chosen Bars frame must also be enabled on the Bars tab. Off shows no bar."] = "此分類的冷卻顯示在哪個計時條框體中。所選的計時條框體還必須在【計時條框體】標籤頁中啟用。【關閉】則不顯示計時條。"
L["Which lane this category's cooldowns travel along. The chosen lane must also be enabled on the Lanes tab - one marked (off) draws nothing."] = "此分類的冷卻沿哪條軌道移動。所選軌道還必須在【軌道】標籤頁中啟用，標記為（關閉）的軌道不會繪製任何內容。"
L["Which lane this cooldown travels in. Default follows this category's Default Lane, set on the Defaults tab."] = "此冷卻在哪條軌道上移動。【預設】跟隨該分類在【預設值】標籤頁中設定的【預設軌道】。"
L["While inside a delve, tracks the two bonus-chest objectives - Nemesis Strongbox packs and the Sanctified Banner - so you know you've grabbed the extra loot before pulling the boss."] = "在探究中追蹤兩個額外寶箱目標 - 死敵保險箱的怪物組和 Sanctified Banner - 讓你在開首領之前確認額外戰利品都已到手。"
L["Wind pulses out from the middle. Stand in one of the small slices with no wind. The wide ones kill outright."] = "狂風從中心向外擴散。站進其中一個沒有風的小扇區。寬的扇區會直接秒殺。"
